Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, I do confess to you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管过去几周来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I have lain with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我几乎夜夜与王后同床\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost every night these past weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我的良知却不允许我履行婚姻的实质\N{\fnArial\fs30}My conscience will not permit me to consummate this marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我认为这场婚姻存有缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I feel there is some impediment to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已尽我所能地努力说服自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done as much as any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从感情上从理智上接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}to move the consent of my heart and mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但良知上的负担却怎么也无法排除\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the obstacle will not out of my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the truth is that there existed a.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛林公爵之子与公主有婚约在先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precontract between the duke of lorraine's son and the Princess after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且这层关系从未解除 因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}from which she was never released, And so therefore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实际上是娶了位有夫之妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really married to another man's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事交由你们去审查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我是否多虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to investigate whether or not my scruples are justified.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 您必须为陛下的良知找个开脱之法\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord, you must find some way to relieve his majesty's conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, charles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这场婚姻维持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}God will not grant me any more children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝是不会再赐予我孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I continue in this marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她果真如此无知 不知道新婚之夜该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she such a maid that she didn't know what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个对大婚之夜不谙就里的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not telling a woman what she must expect on her wedding night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就如同不带干粮直接出海的水手\N{\fnArial\fs30}is like sending a sailor to sea with no biscuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会勒令柯伦威尔设法解除这个婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will force cromwell to bring about a dissolution of the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原本我只是为了国家的安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only went ahead with it for the sake of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可如今这个理由已经无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}The realm and now even that reason is forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝和法国国王又一次决裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor and the king of france are at each other's throats again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且都要来求爱 现在谁还需要克里维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and both have come courting. who needs cleves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场婚姻不是克伦威尔大人的主意么\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord cromwell. was the match not his idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下 玛丽公主到\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty, the princess mary is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公主殿下 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}princess, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了一位表兄弟的来函\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have received a letter from a cousin of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴伐利亚的菲利浦公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is duke philip of bavaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲利普打算来英国向您求爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip would like to come to england and pay court to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他听说了许多关于您的事 玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has heard many things about you, princess mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多善事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他应该是路德教徒的 和您一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose he's a lutheran, like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很有魅力长得也英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is charming and very good looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想您应该会喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might like him a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要对他怎么说 - 就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What shall I tell him? - tell him…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就说只要他愿意并且国王准许 他可以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him he may come if he pleases and if the king wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但别抱太大期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not to expect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格里高利\N{\fnArial\fs30}gregory!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这儿干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你见您把药片落在药剂师那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I noticed you forgot your pills at the apothecary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不希望您受痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to be in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近忙什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what are you working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在为议会准备关于医疗行业的法案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm preparing some bills for parliament on the medical profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还试着说服陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm trying to persuade his majesty to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据其政绩任命官员 就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appoint councillors based upon merit, and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您看上去很累 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look tired, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下怎么样 - 他还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is his majesty? - he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的腿病困扰着他 疼的时候 他就会暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}His leg bothers him; it gets sore. he gets irritable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他有时就拿您撒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that why he strikes you on the head sometimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不怨国王 但其他人却在想法推倒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I resent the king nothing, but others seek to undermine me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我出身如此卑微 而他们如此高贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I was born so low and they so high…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 还有其他原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for other reasons too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别太在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think not on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照顾好你的妻子 以及她腹中的胎儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after your own dear wife, and the child in her belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如爱上帝及上帝的旨意般爱他们 就会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love them as you love god and his holy word, and all shall be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很遗憾您没能抓到那个狡猾的叛徒雷金纳德·珀尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you failed to capture that arch traitor reginald pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王对他恨之入骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king detests him above all men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 他现在正受另一件事的困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, he has other matters on his mind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上次同陛下谈话时他告诉我 他对他目前的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I last spoke to his majesty he confessed he was, in some ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 多少有些厌倦 - 是生活还是他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tired with his life. - his life or his wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基本上是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are much the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就不能找点乐子么 就像从前那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}can he not find distraction, as he has always done before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是不难 但他比以往难伺候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}easily. but he is more jaded than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去的那些已不再配他的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual remedies won't suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得要更 极致的 才能吸引他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something more… extreme… might tempt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少在这种事上 公爵大人 我不会让陛下失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this matter at least, your grace, I shall not fail the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主 请恕我冒昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess mary, I hope you can forgive my impetuosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们本当彼此正式介绍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we should have been formally introduced, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但我等不及了 - 您就是菲利普公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't wait. - you are duke philip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能亲吻您的手么\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I kiss your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望能再次见到您 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I might see you again, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 有我的表姐王后在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my cousin the queen present, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本打算明天回乡下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had thought to leave court tomorrow for the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.27,0:08:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我可以推迟行程 如果这能使您欢喜的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may delay my leaving, if it pleases you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一或两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a day or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰贝斯宫 伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}我亲爱的弗朗西斯 我太想您了|my sweet francis, I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是那么英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handsome as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好久没见您了 最近在忙什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen you for ages. what have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 忙着去杀人 - 成功了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- trying to kill someone. - did you manage it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想您是来看望我的小可爱们的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you've come to look over my little darlings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也得让我先把您看个够 我亲爱的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}only after I've feasted my eyes on you, my dear lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去你的 最近来了几位新姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}go along. we have some new ones, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂亮的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有时简直难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sometimes find it hard to believe that whoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们的父母怎么能狠心丢弃她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bore them did not feel bothered or obliged to raise them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不是说她们多数是私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you told me most of them were bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那是贵族的私生子 我可爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but aristocratic bastards, my sweet boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贵族私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aristocratic bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给娃娃做条裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a dress for our doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我之前见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've seen him here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他是谁 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- who do you think he is? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说他跟人斗过剑么\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think he's been in a sword fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到能取悦陛下的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have found someone to amuse the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}her name is miss katherine howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是诺福克公爵的远亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a distant relation to the duke of norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的出身 怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her background is… how shall I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是真正意义的高贵血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not entirely conventional.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想她一定年轻貌美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume she's young and pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己看吧 大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}see for yourself, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may come in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 这两位就是我跟你说过的大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, these are the excellent people I told you of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨福克公爵大人 赫特福德伯爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His grace, the duke of suffolk, and the earl of hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你多大了 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}how old are you, katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十七岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道是谁教她数数的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder who taught her to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说你自己 你的家庭情况 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell us something about yourself. your family. so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}母亲在我很小的时候就已去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mother died when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲续弦 但我和继母感情疏淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father remarried, but I didn't know his wife really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被送去孀居的公爵夫人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent to live in the household of the dowager duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那应该是诺福克的遗孀公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would be the dowager duchess of norfolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 二世公爵的孀妻 - 我想是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The widow of the second duke - I suppose so, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟她见面不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see her much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那儿还有好多孩子 来自各类婚姻状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were other children there, from lots of marriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们玩得可疯了 很有趣呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran a little wild. there was some fun in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, sweet katherine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看你又可以开始找乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the fun is just about to start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您觉得怎样 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think, your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看她挺合国王口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she looks fit for a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 您跟他 跟菲利浦说过话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, did you talk to him? to philip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 说了几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little. yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他是个聪明的小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he is a very intelligent young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且十分俊俏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and extremely good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对您十分倾心哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}he likes you a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他几乎都还不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有任何共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have nothing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 菲利浦公爵请求接见\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty, duke philip asks for an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我可不想见他 - 那到里边去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want to see him. - then go in there! quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲利浦 我亲爱的表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, philip. my dear cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您觉得这个国家如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you find this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很喜欢英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住在这里一定会很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could most happily live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 您见到过玛丽公主了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, you've met princess mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然只有一面之缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was only for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可那时的情景总在脑海中不断重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I relive that moment over and over again in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此前我听闻她彬彬有礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told before that she was charming,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机智过人 博览群书 和蔼可亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}intelligent, well-read, gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是阿拉贡的凯瑟琳王后之嫡女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The true heir of katherine of aragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位真正的公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我没想到她如此美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing prepared me for her beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的美丽发自内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a beauty that comes from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我而言 她是这世间最美的女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, she is the most beautiful creature on god's earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}枢密院已遵照陛下的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the council has acted upon your majesty's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向王后的公使索要其此前与洛林公爵之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We demanded written evidence of the queen's envoy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚约之书面文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pre-marriage contract to the duke of lorraine's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们已交付 可据文件所载\N{\fnArial\fs30}They provided it, but the papers seem to suggest that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与通常所用的措辞 婚约承诺 不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of the usual formula, "per verba de futuro",
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文件中的准确措辞为 即时生效婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actual wording on the document reads "per verba de presenti",
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说该婚约具有法律约束力 不能解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a binding contract which renunciation cannot undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 陛下尽可放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it does seem that your majesty has reason to be optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王注意到你了 他也许会要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king has noticed you. he may ask to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该跟他说什么 我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what shall I say to him? what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}just be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那女孩子是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is katherine howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺福克公爵家的远亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a relation to the duke of norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进宫没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has only just come to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带她来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 凯瑟琳·霍华德小姐到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, miss katherine howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请 来这坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, be seated here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您嫁人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you married?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}识字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 能写信 - 谁给你写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- enough to write a letter. - who writes to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥有很多房产吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have many houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我去 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ouch! - what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您踩着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stepped on my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲利浦 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}philip, I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您道歉 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do apologize. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲利浦 我真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我以为 - 您没踩着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought… - you didn't step on my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么可能呢 您脚步轻盈几乎不沾地\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you? your feet don't even touch the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和您单独在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted a moment alone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是因为我太快乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}only because I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能再亲您一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you like me to kiss you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道这个戒指的渊源吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know where this ring comes from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾被陈列在肯特布雷大教堂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It once adorned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·拜科特主教神坛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shrine of thomas becket at canterbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个神坛珠光宝气 摆满各国王室与朝圣者的供品\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole shrine glittered with jewels, left by princes and pilgrims.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ring…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这戒指是最珍贵的供品\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ring was the most valuable gift of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位法国国王贡献出此物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king of france left it as an offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只为他的灵魂得到救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save his mortal soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能摸一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 公主殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}good night, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}good night, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me, mr. cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无双宫建造进度怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}how is work proceeding on my palace at nonsuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我高兴地回禀 宫殿即将建造完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pleased to report that it is almost complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}七月里您就可以巡视进度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will be ready for your personal inspection come july.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要送块土地给凯瑟琳·霍华德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give a gift of land to mistress katherine howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近我们查抄了个罪犯的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is some we recently confiscated from a felon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我没记错 那块地上还有两栋大宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I remember correctly. with two large houses upon it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望将之全部赐给霍华德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to grant the whole to mistress howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说枢密院已找到王后前次婚约里的纰漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the council found a flaw in the queen's precontract.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果王后本人否认该项婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not such a flaw that it could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个纰漏也未必有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be overcome by the queen's personal repudiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但应该还是有法可依\N{\fnArial\fs30}there must still be grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 我不认为她是我的合法妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before god, I think she is not my lawful wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 不论人前人后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever people say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.69,0:21:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众人怎么议论您\N{\fnArial\fs30}mr.Cromwell, either to your face or behind your back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您依然是我枢密院的首席大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still my first minister,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我既没有理由也没有必要怀疑您的爱与忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose love and loyalty I have no cause nor reason to doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有任何军国大事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is anything important to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道谁是最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who best to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 先生 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- mr. cromwell! - mr. cromwell, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 卫斯李先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- mr. cromwell! - mr. risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 交给卫斯李先生 - 我们会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to mr. risley - we're doing our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}very good, very good, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.11,0:22:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 卫斯李先生 谢谢您 先生 - 谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- mr. risley! thank you sir. - thank you. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.57,0:22:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与法国大使的会晤如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}how was your meeting with the french ambassador?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:22:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有意思 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was very interesting, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他告诉我法国国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that the king was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已不再反对同我方秘密协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Averse to opening secret negotiations with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旨在脱离与罗马皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a view to disengaging the french from.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.05,0:23:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不太令人满意的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their disagreeable alliance with the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.53,0:23:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.23,0:23:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使先生还说 如果没有克伦威尔大人从中作梗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador also suggested to me how much anglo-french relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.65,0:23:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英法关系势必会大大改善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would improve if lord cromwell no longer stood as an obstacle to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍华德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}mistress howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王要您收下这个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king would like you to accept a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.38,0:24:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您得谢谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must thank his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.80,0:24:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以自己去谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can thank him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.61,0:24:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.80,0:27:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.85,0:27:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳主教 就等您呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop gardiner. just the man we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.89,0:27:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我们可以开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.19,0:27:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格里高利 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}gregory? what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.18,0:27:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个男孩 我有儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a boy. I have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.43,0:27:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks be to god…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.51,0:28:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子到 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}prince edward, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.77,0:28:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 我召集此次议会会议是为了… - 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- gentlemen, I call this council meeting to order…- cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.25,0:28:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.70,0:28:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿没有你的座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛国贼没资格同绅士们坐在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitors do not sit among gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.92,0:28:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人 您因叛国罪被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord cromwell, you are arrested for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.27,0:28:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.51,0:29:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问你们 凭你们的良心 我是不是叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you, on your consciences, am I a traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 叛国贼 叛国贼 - 叛国贼 叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yes! traitor! traitor! - traitor! traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.97,0:29:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 叛国贼 叛国贼 - 叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- traitor! traitor! - traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.74,0:29:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是叛国贼 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no traitor! I am no traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.53,0:29:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.98,0:29:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… no, no. no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.59,0:29:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主 请坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}princess mary, do sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有 有一个消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some… some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲利普公爵已被遣返回巴伐利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke philip has been sent back to bavaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您父亲 国王 送他走的 我很遗憾 我不能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father, the king, sent him away. I am so sorry. I cannot explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.51,0:30:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没必要解释 这无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}no need to explain. it is of little matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.37,0:30:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵很温柔 但我不可能嫁给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duke was charming but I would never have married him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是路德会教徒 而我是天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a lutheran and I am a catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.88,0:31:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.58,0:31:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我特来此提出一项弹劾托马斯·克伦威尔的议案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am come here to introduce a bill of.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.42,0:31:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指控他犯有叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attainder against thomas cromwell on a charge of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.11,0:31:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出身极其卑微 受到了陛下的大力提拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whom his majesty has raised from a very base and low degree,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.62,0:31:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}获得陛下的慷慨馈赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And enriched with manifold gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.91,0:31:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却被证实是个最为不忠腐坏的叛国者和欺诈犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}is proved to be a most false and corrupt traitor and deceiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛国贼 叛国贼 叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor! traitor! traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.39,0:31:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一名恶劣的异教分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}being a detestable heretic,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.75,0:31:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}极力怂恿撺掇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has utterly disposed to set and sow common.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.45,0:31:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在陛下忠诚的子民们中煽动叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedition among your majesty's loyal and loving subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为负责宗教改革的副执事 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the vice-regent for religion supposed to oversee reform, cromwell has,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.31,0:32:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在陛下不知情的情况下 许可异教分子传教布道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without his majesty's knowledge, licensed heretics to preach and teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.05,0:32:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人 我们有确实证据 三月三十一日当晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, we have evidence that on the night of march the 31st,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在圣彼得平民教区\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the parish of st.Peter the poor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.91,0:32:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人目中无人地替那些异教传教士辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord cromwell did arrogantly defend these heretic preachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说即使国王反对改革 他也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said if the king should turn against reform, he would not turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果国王及其追随者果真反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the king did turn, and all his followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.01,0:32:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他将会手执利剑起来战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he would stand fighting in the field with his sword in his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.13,0:32:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反抗国王和他的追随者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the king and against all his followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他取出他的短剑 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he took out his dagger, and he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.43,0:32:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若我不会为纷争而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}"or let this dagger thrust me to the heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.35,0:32:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就让这柄短剑刺穿我的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}"if I would not die for that quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.94,0:32:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如若令我多活上一或两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and if I should live a year or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.39,0:32:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我不会再替国王效命\N{\fnArial\fs30}"then it will no longer be in the king's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阻止或妨碍改革的进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power any more to resist or hinder our reformation."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.01,0:32:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他发下一个重誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he swore a great oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛国贼 叛徒 叛国贼 叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor! traitor! traitor! traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.26,0:33:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您爱这个人 这是不是真的 理查德爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it true that you loved this man, sir richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我爱他主要是因为 我以为我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I chiefly loved him for the love I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他爱陛下胜于一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him bear towards the king above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.46,0:33:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在 如果他是个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, if he be a traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.42,0:33:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我很遗憾我曾爱他信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I am sorry that I ever loved him or trusted him,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.21,0:33:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我很高兴他的叛国罪及时地被揭露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am very glad that his treason is discovered in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.28,0:33:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛国贼 叛国贼 制裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor! traitor! justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.50,0:33:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信 夫人 您在此很愉快也被招待得很好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust, madam, you are happy and well treated?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.56,0:33:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有任何可挑剔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no complaints whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.18,0:33:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走到哪里都获得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere I go I am treated with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众人的尊敬和友善的对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great respect and kindness from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:34:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.06,0:34:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不吃么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.23,0:34:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我… 我想知道 - 我要把您送到我在里士满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… I wondered… - I am sending you away for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.65,0:34:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宫殿待一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my palace at richmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了您的健康 和您的愉悦心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your health, and for your pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.08,0:34:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.41,0:34:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有要事亟待处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some urgent business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.06,0:34:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.45,0:35:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您作为教廷的首脑 议会认为您有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}the council considers it sufficient, as head of the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.24,0:35:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勒令主教宣告您的婚姻无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can have the bishops annul your union.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.35,0:35:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但出于外交考虑 最好您能找到证据证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it would be more diplomatic if you should find proof that the.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.13,0:35:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的婚姻并未正式生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage was never consummated and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.74,0:35:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且陛下你也从未真正认可过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty never truly consented to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.14,0:35:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派代表去见克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}send a deputation to mr. cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.71,0:35:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求他出具书面证明支持我废除婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demand of him written evidence supporting my annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.61,0:35:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疑他该记得我多次向他提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubtless he'll remember how often I spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.64,0:35:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有多么厌恶那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To him of how my nature abhors that woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.68,0:35:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}mr. cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.70,0:35:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.65,0:35:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王命令您为他写封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king orders that you write him a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.64,0:36:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}描述他是如何看待克里维斯的安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Describing how he found anne of cleves,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他关于此事是如何向您交待的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What passed between you on that subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.87,0:36:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及他是否告诉过您\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whether he told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.84,0:36:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在场所谓的婚姻里 他有没有真正圆过房\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had consummated his so-called marriage or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.09,0:36:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还命令您描述此项婚姻之纰漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also orders you to describe the impediments to the marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及明知纰漏的情况下 仍执意安排了联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether knowing them you still arranged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.04,0:36:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下责令您\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty charges that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.23,0:36:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于您在严酷的审判之日将面对上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you will answer god on the dreadful day of judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的灵魂与良知都已极端危险必遭天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also upon the extreme danger and damnation of your soul and conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把您知道的都明确写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to write down exactly what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.20,0:36:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会愉悦地谨尊皇命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will most gladly do as the king commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要国王能欢喜和满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust to his pleasure and satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.52,0:36:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希求国王的舒心比什么都紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire more than anything else the king's comfort,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.80,0:36:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为此捐躯也在所不辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would most willingly die for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:37:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道从这扇窗能否看到您的宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered if you could see your house from that window?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.90,0:37:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实是 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is, mr.Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.25,0:37:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在您被捕仅两小时后\N{\fnArial\fs30}That only two hours after your arrest the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.95,0:37:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王便派遣司库去清缴了您的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatched his treasurer there to take away your goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.70,0:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一群乌合之众拥出来欢呼雀跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabble came out to cheer them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.34,0:37:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说 那场景可热闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pretty sight, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.07,0:37:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卫兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.95,0:38:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在知道陛下对此安排并不如我所预想的那么满意时\N{\fnArial\fs30}"finding your majesty not as pleased "as I trusted to have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.28,0:38:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍斗胆向您问询对皇后的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so bold "to ask you how you liked the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.91,0:38:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下严肃地答道 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"your majesty soberly answered, ""as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.07,0:38:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前就不甚喜欢她 现在愈加厌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked her not well before, "but now I like her much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.47,0:38:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我触摸过她的腹部和胸部 因而\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i have felt her belly and her breasts "and thereby, as I can judge,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.23,0:38:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能判断她不是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should be no maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.80,0:38:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让她来时什么样就是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left her as good a maid as I found her!""
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后呢 他最后写了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the end. what does he say at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.57,0:38:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我谦恭地恳求陛下见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i beseech your majesty most humbly "to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.17,0:38:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这封粗陋的来信 并请您了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my rude writing and to consider that I,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.25,0:38:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 这个最悲伤的囚犯 做好了受死的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}A most woeful prisoner, am ready to take the death,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.38,0:38:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要能博得上帝和您的欢心就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it shall please god and your majesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.82,0:38:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我这孱弱的躯壳却迫使我不断向您乞求您的怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the frail flesh incites me continually to call to your grace for.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.31,0:39:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽恕我的罪 乞求基督的拯救和保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy and grace for my offences, and thus christ save,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.35,0:39:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝与您同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}preserve, and keep you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.77,0:39:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写于伦敦塔 6月30日 六月最后一个星期三\N{\fnArial\fs30}written at the tower this wednesday, …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.40,0:39:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藉由一颗沉重的心和颤抖的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of june with heavy heart and trembling hand of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您最可悲的囚犯和仆人敬上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness' most heavy and miserable prisoner and poor slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.20,0:39:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信的最下面他还写了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's written something right down at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.71,0:39:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最仁慈的君主啊 求您发发慈悲 慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"most gracious prince, I cry for mercy, mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.70,0:39:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发发慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.33,0:40:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人您明天会去塔山吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will your grace be on tower hill tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.72,0:40:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别算上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to keep me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.63,0:40:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以向大人承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can vouchsafe to your grace his.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的结局绝对是最屈辱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final end will be the most ignominious ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.25,0:40:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到了 大人 听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I have heard, your grace. so I have heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.55,0:40:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是什么意思 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is he talking about? tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.82,0:40:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔会在亨格福特大人 也就是疯子沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}cromwell is set to appear on the same scaffold as lord hungerford…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.58,0:40:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被处死的同一个断头台上受刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise known as mad walter,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.22,0:40:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那人被控多项罪名被判死刑 比如鸡奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has been sentenced to death for various offences such as sodomy,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.00,0:40:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强奸自己的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raping his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让术师们预测国王的死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}and paying magicians to predict the date of the king's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.50,0:40:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少他不用费心为预测自己的死期付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least he won't have to pay them to predict the date of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么克伦威尔会很丢脸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then cromwell will be humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.98,0:40:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个恶劣的下等人 狼子野心害了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The false churl who was so ambitious for others' blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.75,0:41:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的手段还不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah, that is not our only device.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.62,0:41:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆和我还想出更绝的 让那位大大尝尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom and I have conceived some more sport at his lordship's expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.29,0:41:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耐心点儿 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}patience edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.93,0:41:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耐心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.62,0:41:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来一罐啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's have another beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.84,0:41:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我忘了你的名字了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, there; I've forgotten your name, fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.99,0:41:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是什么来着 - 先生 是格利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it again? - gurrea, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.53,0:41:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格利亚 你生过梅毒还是好了 俄利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}gurrea. d'you have the pox or is it gone, 'urrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.66,0:41:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天有重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.47,0:41:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该去睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ought to be abed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.80,0:41:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后一品脱 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}a last pint! I'm paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.62,0:41:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们再为老朋友喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then let's drink to old friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.60,0:41:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外来两品脱 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more pints, my good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.04,0:42:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格利亚师傅 我相信你今早已经清醒了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}master gurrea, I trust you're feeling clear- headed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.86,0:42:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 哈特福德伯爵觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, the earl of hartford is come.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.21,0:42:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.59,0:42:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我特来向您通知 议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}madam, it is my duty to inform you that parliament,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坎特伯雷和约克的正式会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The convocations of canterbury and york.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.62,0:43:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确认您与国王的婚姻无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}have found your marriage to the king to be invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.75,0:43:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于您和洛林家有婚约在先\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the grounds Of your precontract with lorraine,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.07,0:43:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王亦不赞同这桩婚事 并且你们没有圆房\N{\fnArial\fs30}his majesty's lack of consent to the marriage, and its non-consummation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.23,0:43:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这桩婚姻特此宣告无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marriage is thus declared null and void,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.47,0:43:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自此以后 若您自称为他的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from henceforth it is the king's.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.23,0:43:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王将十分欣喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure that you call yourself his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.90,0:43:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您赞同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you consent?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.92,0:43:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.85,0:43:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以告诉您 国王给您准备了多达4000英镑的年金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you that the king has settled upon you a handsome annuity of 4, 000 pounds per annum.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.94,0:43:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并赠予您布莱彻和里士满的庄园以及希威城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as the manors of bletchingly and richmond, and also hever castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.58,0:43:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要您在英国就都是您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so long as you remain in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.78,0:43:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于国王确认您仍是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since his majesty confirms that you are still a maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.95,0:43:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以自行择偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to marry whom you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.79,0:44:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您\N{\fnArial\fs30}please…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.71,0:44:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the king that…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.13,0:44:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望有朝一日能有幸再见他的尊面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I will sometimes have the pleasure of his most noble presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.34,0:44:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并祈求全能的主能够保佑他长寿和健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beseech the almighty to send him long life and good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.82,0:44:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.60,0:44:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}father!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.34,0:44:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.88,0:45:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好人们啊 我来此是受死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}good people, I am come here to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.47,0:45:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是为洗脱我的罪 尽管有人认为我该这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not to purge myself, as some may think I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.85,0:45:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被依法判处死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am by law condemned to die and I thank my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.52,0:45:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢我主对我的犯下的罪赐予死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God that has granted me this death for my offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.20,0:45:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我长久以来冒犯了上帝 是个罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For since I came of age I have lived as a sinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.79,0:45:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我衷心祈求得到祂的宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and offended my lord god for which I ask him heartily for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.94,0:45:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭嘴吧 看到上帝的份儿上 闭嘴受死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}get it over with! for christ's sake, get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.24,0:45:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也冒犯了我的君王 为此我恳求他的宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have also offended my prince, for which I ask him hearty amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.51,0:45:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我衷心希望你们能为国王祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heartily desire you to pray for the king's grace and.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.98,0:46:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望他能健康富足地和你们生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he may long live with you in health and prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.30,0:46:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继他之后 他的儿子 爱德华王子能长久统治你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that after him his son, prince edward, may long reign over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.97,0:46:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这儿了 无双宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}there it is. nonsuch palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.47,0:46:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小丑告诉我 它不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fool told me it didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.29,0:46:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 你们应该从我这里得到警示\N{\fnArial\fs30}gentlemen, you should all take warning from me, who was, as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.81,0:46:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从一介草民受到国王的提拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was, as you know, from a poor man made by the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.81,0:46:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为了举足轻重的重臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a great gentleman and that i, not contented with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.89,0:46:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却仍不满足 不满于王国由我治理\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with having the kingdom at my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.20,0:46:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍不停寻求更高的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}presumed to a still higher state.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.76,0:47:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的自大最终带来了惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}my pride has brought its punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.62,0:47:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 当我的双眼不能视物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, grant me that when these eyes shall lose their use,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.57,0:47:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请赐予我灵魂的双眼使我能看到您\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eyes of my soul may see thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.65,0:47:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝天父啊 当我的嘴失去作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}God lord and father, that when this mouth shall lose his use…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.72,0:47:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.69,0:47:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的心能说话 天父 我将灵魂放予您的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my heart that say to thee father, into your hands I commend my spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.43,0:47:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快啊 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on now! take his head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.79,0:47:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为国王 议会大臣们祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}pray for the prince and for the lords of the council,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.29,0:47:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为牧师们以及人民祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for the clergy and for the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.48,0:47:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在再次请求你们也会为我祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I beg you again that you will pray for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.55,0:47:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈祷 可以的话 我能一击毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray, if possible, cut off the head with one blow…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.66,0:48:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我就不用太痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I may not suffer much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.15,0:48:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}砍头\N{\fnArial\fs30}chop it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.39,0:50:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
